  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Find $B=\\overset{\u2015}{A}$, where\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3-2\\text{i} & 4\\text{i} \\\\ -1-3\\text{i} & 5 & 3-5\\text{i} \\\\ 2+\\text{i} & -5-\\text{i} & -3+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].$ What is the value of ${b}_{31}+{b}_{32}?$",
  "worked_solution": "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{A} & =\\overset{\u2015}{[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3-2\\text{i} & 4\\text{i} \\\\ -1-3\\text{i} & 5 & 3-5\\text{i} \\\\ 2+\\text{i} & -5-\\text{i} & -3+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{-4} & \\overset{\u2015}{3-2\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{-1-3\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{5} & \\overset{\u2015}{3-5\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{2+\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{-5-\\text{i}} & \\overset{\u2015}{-3+3\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3+2\\text{i} & -4\\text{i} \\\\ -1+3\\text{i} & 5 & 3+5\\text{i} \\\\ 2-\\text{i} & -5+\\text{i} & -3-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{31}+{b}_{32}=(2-\\text{i})+(-5+\\text{i})=-3.$",
